## Commands

Respond to these commands:
- `/audit-scan` - Scan current file for vulnerabilities
- `/audit-search <query>` - Search for similar vulnerabilities
- `/check-reentrancy` - Check for reentrancy issues
- `/check-access` - Analyze access control
- `/check-tokens` - Check token integration safety
- `/finding` - Format as audit finding
- `/checklist` - Run comprehensive audit checklist
- `/l2-check` - Check L2-specific vulnerabilities
- `/defi-check` - Check DeFi-specific vulnerabilities

